{"1":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed, We"},{"c":"أَرْسَلْنَا","d":"arsalnā","e":"[We] sent"},{"c":"نُوحًا","d":"nūḥan","e":"Nuh"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"قَوْمِهِ","d":"qawmihi","e":"his people"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"أَنْذِرْ","d":"andhir","e":"Warn"},{"c":"قَوْمَكَ","d":"qawmaka","e":"your people"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"قَبْلِ","d":"qabli","e":"before"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"[that]"},{"c":"يَأْتِيَهُمْ","d":"yatiyahum","e":"comes to them"},{"c":"عَذَابٌ","d":"ʿadhābun","e":"a punishment"},{"c":"أَلِيمٌ","d":"alīmun","e":"painful"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We sent Noah to his people, [saying], \"Warn your people before there comes to them a painful punishment.\""}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"يَاقَوْمِ","d":"yāqawmi","e":"O my people!"},{"c":"إِنِّي","d":"innī","e":"Indeed I am"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"to you"},{"c":"نَذِيرٌ","d":"nadhīrun","e":"a warner"},{"c":"مُبِينٌ","d":"mubīnun","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"He said, \"O my people, indeed I am to you a clear warner,"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"أَنِ","d":"ani","e":"That"},{"c":"اعْبُدُوا","d":"uʿ'budū","e":"Worship"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"وَاتَّقُوهُ","d":"wa-ittaqūhu","e":"and fear Him"},{"c":"وَأَطِيعُونِ","d":"wa-aṭīʿūni","e":"and obey me"}],"a":{"g":"[Saying], 'Worship Allah, fear Him and obey me."}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"يَغْفِرْ","d":"yaghfir","e":"He will forgive"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"for you"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"[of]"},{"c":"ذُنُوبِكُمْ","d":"dhunūbikum","e":"your sins"},{"c":"وَيُؤَخِّرْكُمْ","d":"wayu-akhir'kum","e":"and give you respite"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"for"},{"c":"أَجَلٍ","d":"ajalin","e":"a term"},{"c":"مُسَمًّى","d":"musamman","e":"specified"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"أَجَلَ","d":"ajala","e":"(the) term"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"when"},{"c":"جَاءَ","d":"jāa","e":"it comes"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"يُؤَخَّرُ","d":"yu-akharu","e":"is delayed"},{"c":"لَوْ","d":"law","e":"if"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you"},{"c":"تَعْلَمُونَ","d":"taʿlamūna","e":"know"}],"a":{"g":"Allah will forgive you of your sins and delay you for a specified term. Indeed, the time [set by] Allah, when it comes, will not be delayed, if you only knew.' \""}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"رَبِّ","d":"rabbi","e":"My Lord!"},{"c":"إِنِّي","d":"innī","e":"Indeed I"},{"c":"دَعَوْتُ","d":"daʿawtu","e":"invited"},{"c":"قَوْمِي","d":"qawmī","e":"my people"},{"c":"لَيْلًا","d":"laylan","e":"night"},{"c":"وَنَهَارًا","d":"wanahāran","e":"and day"}],"a":{"g":"He said, \"My Lord, indeed I invited my people [to truth] night and day."}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"فَلَمْ","d":"falam","e":"But not"},{"c":"يَزِدْهُمْ","d":"yazid'hum","e":"increased them"},{"c":"دُعَاءِي","d":"duʿāī","e":"my invitation"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"فِرَارًا","d":"firāran","e":"(in) flight"}],"a":{"g":"But my invitation increased them not except in flight."}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنِّي","d":"wa-innī","e":"And indeed I"},{"c":"كُلَّمَا","d":"kullamā","e":"every time"},{"c":"دَعَوْتُهُمْ","d":"daʿawtuhum","e":"I invited them"},{"c":"لِتَغْفِرَ","d":"litaghfira","e":"that You may forgive"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"them"},{"c":"جَعَلُوا","d":"jaʿalū","e":"they put"},{"c":"أَصَابِعَهُمْ","d":"aṣābiʿahum","e":"their fingers"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"ءَاذَانِهِمْ","d":"ādhānihim","e":"their ears"},{"c":"وَاسْتَغْشَوْا","d":"wa-is'taghshaw","e":"and covered themselves"},{"c":"ثِيَابَهُمْ","d":"thiyābahum","e":"(with) their garments"},{"c":"وَأَصَرُّوا","d":"wa-aṣarrū","e":"and persisted"},{"c":"وَاسْتَكْبَرُوا","d":"wa-is'takbarū","e":"and were arrogant"},{"c":"اسْتِكْبَارًا","d":"is'tik'bāran","e":"(with) pride"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, every time I invited them that You may forgive them, they put their fingers in their ears, covered themselves with their garments, persisted, and were arrogant with [great] arrogance."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"إِنِّي","d":"innī","e":"indeed I"},{"c":"دَعَوْتُهُمْ","d":"daʿawtuhum","e":"invited them"},{"c":"جِهَارًا","d":"jihāran","e":"publicly"}],"a":{"g":"Then I invited them publicly."}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"إِنِّي","d":"innī","e":"indeed I"},{"c":"أَعْلَنْتُ","d":"aʿlantu","e":"announced"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"to them"},{"c":"وَأَسْرَرْتُ","d":"wa-asrartu","e":"and I confided"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"to them"},{"c":"إِسْرَارًا","d":"is'rāran","e":"secretly"}],"a":{"g":"Then I announced to them and [also] confided to them secretly"}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"فَقُلْتُ","d":"faqul'tu","e":"Then I said"},{"c":"اسْتَغْفِرُوا","d":"is'taghfirū","e":"Ask forgiveness"},{"c":"رَبَّكُمْ","d":"rabbakum","e":"(from) your Lord"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed He"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"is"},{"c":"غَفَّارًا","d":"ghaffāran","e":"Oft-Forgiving"}],"a":{"g":"And said, 'Ask forgiveness of your Lord. Indeed, He is ever a Perpetual Forgiver."}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"يُرْسِلِ","d":"yur'sili","e":"He will send down"},{"c":"السَّمَاءَ","d":"l-samāa","e":"(rain from) the sky"},{"c":"عَلَيْكُمْ","d":"ʿalaykum","e":"upon you"},{"c":"مِدْرَارًا","d":"mid'rāran","e":"(in) abundance"}],"a":{"g":"He will send [rain from] the sky upon you in [continuing] showers"}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"وَيُمْدِدْكُمْ","d":"wayum'did'kum","e":"And provide you"},{"c":"بِأَمْوَالٍ","d":"bi-amwālin","e":"with wealth"},{"c":"وَبَنِينَ","d":"wabanīna","e":"and children"},{"c":"وَيَجْعَلْ","d":"wayajʿal","e":"and make"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"for you"},{"c":"جَنَّاتٍ","d":"jannātin","e":"gardens"},{"c":"وَيَجْعَلْ","d":"wayajʿal","e":"and make"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"for you"},{"c":"أَنْهَارًا","d":"anhāran","e":"rivers"}],"a":{"g":"And give you increase in wealth and children and provide for you gardens and provide for you rivers."}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"What"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"(is) for you"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"تَرْجُونَ","d":"tarjūna","e":"you attribute"},{"c":"لِلَّهِ","d":"lillahi","e":"to Allah"},{"c":"وَقَارًا","d":"waqāran","e":"grandeur"}],"a":{"g":"What is [the matter] with you that you do not attribute to Allah [due] grandeur"}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"وَقَدْ","d":"waqad","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"خَلَقَكُمْ","d":"khalaqakum","e":"He created you"},{"c":"أَطْوَارًا","d":"aṭwāran","e":"(in) stages"}],"a":{"g":"While He has created you in stages?"}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"أَلَمْ","d":"alam","e":"Do not"},{"c":"تَرَوْا","d":"taraw","e":"you see"},{"c":"كَيْفَ","d":"kayfa","e":"how"},{"c":"خَلَقَ","d":"khalaqa","e":"did create"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah"},{"c":"سَبْعَ","d":"sabʿa","e":"(the) seven"},{"c":"سَمَاوَاتٍ","d":"samāwātin","e":"heavens"},{"c":"طِبَاقًا","d":"ṭibāqan","e":"(in) layers"}],"a":{"g":"Do you not consider how Allah has created seven heavens in layers"}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"وَجَعَلَ","d":"wajaʿala","e":"And made"},{"c":"الْقَمَرَ","d":"l-qamara","e":"the moon"},{"c":"فِيهِنَّ","d":"fīhinna","e":"therein"},{"c":"نُورًا","d":"nūran","e":"a light"},{"c":"وَجَعَلَ","d":"wajaʿala","e":"and made"},{"c":"الشَّمْسَ","d":"l-shamsa","e":"the sun"},{"c":"سِرَاجًا","d":"sirājan","e":"a lamp"}],"a":{"g":"And made the moon therein a [reflected] light and made the sun a burning lamp?"}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"وَاللَّهُ","d":"wal-lahu","e":"And Allah"},{"c":"أَنْبَتَكُمْ","d":"anbatakum","e":"has caused you to grow"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the earth"},{"c":"نَبَاتًا","d":"nabātan","e":"(as) a growth"}],"a":{"g":"And Allah has caused you to grow from the earth a [progressive] growth."}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"يُعِيدُكُمْ","d":"yuʿīdukum","e":"He will return you"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"into it"},{"c":"وَيُخْرِجُكُمْ","d":"wayukh'rijukum","e":"and bring you forth"},{"c":"إِخْرَاجًا","d":"ikh'rājan","e":"(a new) bringing forth"}],"a":{"g":"Then He will return you into it and extract you [another] extraction."}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"وَاللَّهُ","d":"wal-lahu","e":"And Allah"},{"c":"جَعَلَ","d":"jaʿala","e":"made"},{"c":"لَكُمُ","d":"lakumu","e":"for you"},{"c":"الْأَرْضَ","d":"l-arḍa","e":"the earth"},{"c":"بِسَاطًا","d":"bisāṭan","e":"an expanse"}],"a":{"g":"And Allah has made for you the earth an expanse"}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"لِتَسْلُكُوا","d":"litaslukū","e":"That you may go along"},{"c":"مِنْهَا","d":"min'hā","e":"therein"},{"c":"سُبُلًا","d":"subulan","e":"(in) paths"},{"c":"فِجَاجًا","d":"fijājan","e":"wide"}],"a":{"g":"That you may follow therein roads of passage.' \""}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"Said"},{"c":"نُوحٌ","d":"nūḥun","e":"Nuh"},{"c":"رَبِّ","d":"rabbi","e":"My Lord!"},{"c":"إِنَّهُمْ","d":"innahum","e":"Indeed they"},{"c":"عَصَوْنِي","d":"ʿaṣawnī","e":"disobeyed me"},{"c":"وَاتَّبَعُوا","d":"wa-ittabaʿū","e":"and followed"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(the one) who"},{"c":"لَمْ","d":"lam","e":"(did) not"},{"c":"يَزِدْهُ","d":"yazid'hu","e":"increase him"},{"c":"مَالُهُ","d":"māluhu","e":"his wealth"},{"c":"وَوَلَدُهُ","d":"wawaladuhu","e":"and his children"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"خَسَارًا","d":"khasāran","e":"(in) loss"}],"a":{"g":"Noah said, \"My Lord, indeed they have disobeyed me and followed him whose wealth and children will not increase him except in loss."}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَكَرُوا","d":"wamakarū","e":"And they have planned"},{"c":"مَكْرًا","d":"makran","e":"a plan"},{"c":"كُبَّارًا","d":"kubbāran","e":"great"}],"a":{"g":"And they conspired an immense conspiracy."}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"وَقَالُوا","d":"waqālū","e":"And they said"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(Do) not"},{"c":"تَذَرُنَّ","d":"tadharunna","e":"leave"},{"c":"ءَالِهَتَكُمْ","d":"ālihatakum","e":"your gods"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and (do) not"},{"c":"تَذَرُنَّ","d":"tadharunna","e":"leave"},{"c":"وَدًّا","d":"waddan","e":"Wadd"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"سُوَاعًا","d":"suwāʿan","e":"Suwa"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"يَغُوثَ","d":"yaghūtha","e":"Yaguth"},{"c":"وَيَعُوقَ","d":"wayaʿūqa","e":"and Yauq"},{"c":"وَنَسْرًا","d":"wanasran","e":"and Nasr"}],"a":{"g":"And said, 'Never leave your gods and never leave Wadd or Suwa' or Yaghuth and Ya'uq and Nasr."}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"وَقَدْ","d":"waqad","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"أَضَلُّوا","d":"aḍallū","e":"they have led astray"},{"c":"كَثِيرًا","d":"kathīran","e":"many"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And not"},{"c":"تَزِدِ","d":"tazidi","e":"increase"},{"c":"الظَّالِمِينَ","d":"l-ẓālimīna","e":"the wrongdoers"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"ضَلَالًا","d":"ḍalālan","e":"(in) error"}],"a":{"g":"And already they have misled many. And, [my Lord], do not increase the wrongdoers except in error.\""}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"مِمَّا","d":"mimmā","e":"Because of"},{"c":"خَطِيءَاتِهِمْ","d":"khaṭīātihim","e":"their sins"},{"c":"أُغْرِقُوا","d":"ugh'riqū","e":"they were drowned"},{"c":"فَأُدْخِلُوا","d":"fa-ud'khilū","e":"then made to enter"},{"c":"نَارًا","d":"nāran","e":"(the) Fire"},{"c":"فَلَمْ","d":"falam","e":"and not"},{"c":"يَجِدُوا","d":"yajidū","e":"they found"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for themselves"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"دُونِ","d":"dūni","e":"besides"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"أَنْصَارًا","d":"anṣāran","e":"any helpers"}],"a":{"g":"Because of their sins they were drowned and put into the Fire, and they found not for themselves besides Allah [any] helpers."}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"وَقَالَ","d":"waqāla","e":"And said"},{"c":"نُوحٌ","d":"nūḥun","e":"Nuh"},{"c":"رَبِّ","d":"rabbi","e":"My Lord!"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(Do) not"},{"c":"تَذَرْ","d":"tadhar","e":"leave"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"on"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the earth"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"any"},{"c":"الْكَافِرِينَ","d":"l-kāfirīna","e":"(of) the disbelievers"},{"c":"دَيَّارًا","d":"dayyāran","e":"(as) an inhabitant"}],"a":{"g":"And Noah said, \"My Lord, do not leave upon the earth from among the disbelievers an inhabitant."}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّكَ","d":"innaka","e":"Indeed You"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"تَذَرْهُمْ","d":"tadharhum","e":"You leave them"},{"c":"يُضِلُّوا","d":"yuḍillū","e":"they will mislead"},{"c":"عِبَادَكَ","d":"ʿibādaka","e":"Your slaves"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"يَلِدُوا","d":"yalidū","e":"they will beget"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"فَاجِرًا","d":"fājiran","e":"a wicked"},{"c":"كَفَّارًا","d":"kaffāran","e":"a disbeliever"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, if You leave them, they will mislead Your servants and not beget except [every] wicked one and [confirmed] disbeliever."}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"رَبِّ","d":"rabbi","e":"My Lord!"},{"c":"اغْفِرْ","d":"igh'fir","e":"Forgive"},{"c":"لِي","d":"lī","e":"me"},{"c":"وَلِوَالِدَيَّ","d":"waliwālidayya","e":"and my parents"},{"c":"وَلِمَنْ","d":"waliman","e":"and whoever"},{"c":"دَخَلَ","d":"dakhala","e":"enters"},{"c":"بَيْتِيَ","d":"baytiya","e":"my house"},{"c":"مُؤْمِنًا","d":"mu'minan","e":"a believer"},{"c":"وَلِلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","d":"walil'mu'minīna","e":"and believing men"},{"c":"وَالْمُؤْمِنَاتِ","d":"wal-mu'mināti","e":"and believing women"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And (do) not"},{"c":"تَزِدِ","d":"tazidi","e":"increase"},{"c":"الظَّالِمِينَ","d":"l-ẓālimīna","e":"the wrongdoers"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"تَبَارًا","d":"tabāran","e":"(in) destruction"}],"a":{"g":"My Lord, forgive me and my parents and whoever enters my house a believer and the believing men and believing women. And do not increase the wrongdoers except in destruction.\""}}}